</style></head><body>
  <header class="brand"><div class="brand-copy"><div class="brand-name">AMO MI VOZ</div><div class="brand-sub">ACADEMIA DE TALENTOS · VOCAL ENGINE</div><h1 style="margin:7px 0 0">Mi informe de progreso vocal</h1></div><img class="brand-logo" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Logo Academia de Talentos Amo mi Voz"></header>
